                <pb facs="0594" n="524" xml:id="pg524"/>


                <head>Mr. Godoy to Mr. Romero</head>
                <p>Señor Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matias Romero,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mexican Minister:</hi></p>
                <p>The news false. I have letters from Mazatlan of January 29.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. A. GODOY.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
